{
  "id": "dp",
  "title": "06 / Fewest Tokens",
  "topic": "Dynamic programming",
  "minutes": 35,
  "level": "Stretch",
  "signature": "function solve(coins, amount)",
  "statement": "正整数の異なる額面 coins を何度でも使って amount を作ります。必要な最少枚数を返し、作れなければ -1 を返してください。\n制約: 0 ≤ amount ≤ 10,000、0 ≤ coins.length ≤ 100。coins の要素は 1〜10,000。amount=0 なら 0。",
  "example": "solve([1,3,4], 6) → 2",
  "hint": "最大の額面から選ぶ貪欲法は [1,3,4],6 で失敗します。dp[x] を「x を作る最少枚数」とすると？",
  "explain": "dp[0]=0、他は Infinity。各 x について dp[x]=min(dp[x-c]+1)。時間 O(amount × coins.length)、領域 O(amount)。到達不可能状態を区別します。",
  "solution": "function solve(coins, amount) {\n  const dp = Array(amount+1).fill(Infinity); dp[0]=0;\n  for (let x=1; x<=amount; x++) {\n    for (const c of coins) if (c<=x) dp[x]=Math.min(dp[x], dp[x-c]+1);\n  }\n  return Number.isFinite(dp[amount]) ? dp[amount] : -1;\n}",
  "tests": [
    {
      "a": [
        [
          1,
          3,
          4
        ],
        6
      ],
      "e": 2
    },
    {
      "a": [
        [
          2
        ],
        3
      ],
      "e": -1
    },
    {
      "a": [
        [
          2
        ],
        0
      ],
      "e": 0
    },
    {
      "a": [
        [],
        5
      ],
      "e": -1
    },
    {
      "a": [
        [
          2,
          5
        ],
        11
      ],
      "e": 4
    },
    {
      "a": [
        [
          7
        ],
        14
      ],
      "e": 2
    }
  ],
  "contentVersion": "2026-10-12.2",
  "authors": [
    {
      "type": "ai-assisted",
      "name": "Original interview-practice material"
    }
  ],
  "sources": []
}

steps.reference:
function solve(coins, amount) {
  const dp = Array(amount+1).fill(Infinity); dp[0]=0;
  for (let x=1; x<=amount; x++) {
    for (const c of coins) if (c<=x) dp[x]=Math.min(dp[x], dp[x-c]+1);
  }
  return Number.isFinite(dp[amount]) ? dp[amount] : -1;
}

